["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom vs. Safety: Axon CEO Rick Smith on the Future of Policing ALPR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-allin-axon-ceo-警用无人机未来该配非致命武器-而不是枪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561dcd474c610c53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Axon CEO:警用無人機未來該配非致命武器，而不是槍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Axon 主張用無人機和機器人搭載非致命武器取代警察持槍對峙，開火權仍歸人類，但要多人實時審批才能啟動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">創業史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 344: Philosophy as Dialogue Seventh Letter aporetic dialogue divine madness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-verybad-柏拉图说真正的哲学教诲根本不能被写下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉圖說真正的哲學教誨根本不能被寫下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉圖在《第七封信》裡說自己從未寫下真正的哲學教誨，因為哲學不完全是命題，而是一種經驗；對話體之所以存在，正是為了承載寫不下來的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉圖</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Designing for Agents — Zeno Rocha, Resend MCP AEO/GEO Domain Connect SES llms.txt\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-latentspace-体量大100倍的对手-却被下载量反超-规模不是护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af0f478aa0a3653b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>體量大100倍的對手，卻被下載量反超：規模不是護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沒有郵件背景的創始人靠產品體驗把下載量反超，而發明DevRel的Twilio收購SendGrid後卻把它晾在一邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">郵件基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">MCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neuron Basis: Goodfire&#x27;s Curt Tigges on Agentic Interp, Monosemanticity &amp; Reverse Engineering gated MLP (SwiGLU) monosemanticity ablation SAE (sparse autoencoder) neuron scientist\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cogrev-单个神经元的含义没有想象中混乱-智能体逐个审问找到答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd1b0999555e3944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>單個神經元的含義沒有想像中混亂：智能體逐個審問找到答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">門控MLP讓神經元只在少數幾個含義間切換而非上百種混雜；AI智能體逐一做實驗驗證後，能用一段描述準確預測神經元的行為，推翻了「神經元太髒讀不懂」的舊說法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Washington keeps helping China catch up in AI | Luisa Rodriguez distillation wakesurfer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-eightythousand-中国ai没有自研超车-靠的是租美国算力-抄美国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad5a0c87762b8e27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>中國AI沒有自研超車，靠的是租美國算力、抄美國模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國模型只落後美國約六個月，但這差距很大程度靠境外租用英偉達芯片和對美國模型的知識蒸餾撐起來——一旦美國堵住這兩條路，真實差距會比看起來大得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片租賃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"HubSpot’s Co-Founder on Finding Your Next Startup Idea Yellow Brick Road second brain context graph evals\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-a16z-chatgpt和claude已是新操作系统-但护城河不在界面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT和Claude已是新操作系統，但護城河不在界面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HubSpot聯合創始人判斷：模型正趨於可替換的基礎設施，沒有人能卡住創業者的供應鏈咽喉；真正的護城河是沉澱下來的工作與數據，而非用戶進入的那個聊天框。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">平臺生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nik Storonsky: The most uncompromising banking CEO K-factor NPAP (New Product Approval Process) OCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cheekypint-revolut-ceo-把银行信贷类比卖期权-收十年租金-一年亏光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d2ccbd206c41a7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Revolut CEO 把銀行信貸類比賣期權：收十年租金，一年虧光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸利潤會被經濟週期一次性抹平，所以 Revolut 把放貸目標壓到資產負債表不到10%、其餘證券化出表，寧可做訂閱制科技公司，也不做傳統淨息差銀行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新型銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">產品運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadi Hamid and Matthew Kaemingk on Whether Democracy Needs Religion idolatry political hobbyism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-goodfight-政治变得越世俗-反而越像一场圣战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>政治變得越世俗，反而越像一場聖戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位作者認為，當人們不再從宗教獲得身份認同與終極意義，這種渴望並未消失，而是轉移進了政治——這正是美國政治走向「聖戰化」的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教與政治</span><span class=\"tag\">政黨政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Elon Musk Solves Problems | Jon McNeill battlefield promotion bill of materials weighted ETF Follow Me Home exercise Fire Yourself exercise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-knowledge-马斯克的产品算法-自动化是最后一步-不是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/586a4f39f9c67632-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克的產品算法：自動化是最後一步，不是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉團隊曾因為先自動化而在同一個問題上卡住數月：馬斯克的算法要求先刪需求、簡化流程、手動跑通，自動化永遠是最後一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span><span class=\"tag\">馬斯克</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"515 從鐵幕創作到解凍文藝：漫談世界電影史中的波蘭巨匠安傑伊·瓦伊達 Zespół filmowy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cn2aa250-波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的-没进戛纳就等于没拍过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>波蘭電影史其實是電影節寫出來的：沒進戛納就等於沒拍過</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者說大衛·波德威爾寫羅馬尼亞電影史時一個字都沒提，不是因為片子差，而是因為那些片子從沒被送到西方能看見的電影節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">波蘭電影</span><span class=\"tag\">冷戰文化政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Perfectly Leveraged for the Squat progressive overload majestic womanhood manhood stones Title IX\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-ninepi-被遗忘的维多利亚大力女明星-当年体重大才被认为又强又美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>被遺忘的維多利亞大力女明星：當年體重大才被認為又強又美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現代人以瘦為美的觀念只有一百多年歷史——維多利亞時代的馬戲團大力女星體重兩百磅，卻被封為「世界上最強壯也最美麗的女人」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性力量史</span><span class=\"tag\">舉重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How college football&#x27;s deadliest year built the NCAA flying wedge mass momentum play NIL death harvest\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-throughline-老罗斯福不是ncaa诞生的真正推手-一场校园死亡才是导火索/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>老羅斯福不是NCAA誕生的真正推手，一場校園死亡才是導火索</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1905年「死亡豐收年」後，真正催生NCAA新規則委員會的不是老羅斯福的三校會議，而是NYU校長繞開大三校另起爐灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育史</span><span class=\"tag\">NCAA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 227 Carbon Monoxide: Haunted houses &amp; coal mine canaries carboxyhemoglobin hyperbaric oxygen\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-tpwky-历史上许多-闹鬼事件-其实是一氧化碳中毒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>歷史上許多「鬧鬼事件」,其實是一氧化碳中毒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一氧化碳不僅搶著跟血紅蛋白結合，還讓已經結合的氧氣釋放不出來——這種雙重機制造成的症狀太詭異，歷史上常被診斷成鬧鬼或精神病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">毒理學</span><span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"297: Why Teens Lie—and How to Respond Without Escalating Haim Ginott smell test perspective game\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-asklisa-心理学家-教孩子对同伴撒谎自保-好过逞强说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fae74bb25cb36023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>心理學家：教孩子對同伴撒謊自保，好過逞強說真話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">面對同伴慫恿抽大麻之類的場合，她寧可教孩子說一句謊把責任推給父母脫身，也不要孩子因找不到體面拒絕方式而冒險——目標是安全優先，不是誠實至上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年教育</span><span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loud, Messy, Physical - What To Do When Kids Won&#x27;t Stop Fighting\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-unruffled-孩子打架别急着拉开-冲突本身就是他们在学社交/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架別急著拉開：衝突本身就是他們在學社交</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">頻繁的尖叫、撕咬甚至打你一巴掌，往往不是孩子出了問題，而是父母越介入，衝突就越容易變成孩子們搶奪「媽媽注意力」的戲碼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">手足衝突</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When You Try What You&#x27;re Bad At | Challenge Accepted\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-goodinside-六枚冬奥奖牌得主说-我更擅长的是重新当一个新手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">48:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>六枚冬奧獎牌得主說：我更擅長的是重新當一個新手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的壘球夢在一次搞砸的試訓後徹底終結，轉去完全陌生的雪車項目，靠的不是天賦延續，而是一次次主動放棄「我很厲害」的身份重新歸零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">成長心態</span><span class=\"tag\">身份認同</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258｜聊聊硅谷創業“修道院”HF0與OpenRouter早期故事 spray and pray subtraction Demo Dinner unified interface for LLMs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-sv101-以为硅谷孵化器教的是增长黑客-学到的却是只做一件事的减法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">54:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>以為硅谷孵化器教的是增長黑客，學到的卻是只做一件事的減法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人說最難的減法不是去掉不重要的娛樂，而是只盯住對公司最重要的那件事，甚至排除掉第二重要的事情。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">HF0</span><span class=\"tag\">孵化器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"151 ✪ 從「需要」到「想要」：中國時尚品牌集體向上 lookbook intangible assets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-fengtouquan-消费降级论被打脸-千元档国货时尚品牌增速是大盘六倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>消費降級論被打臉：千元檔國貨時尚品牌增速是大盤六倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天貓數據顯示，客單價1500至2000元的輕奢價位國貨品牌，今年成交增速是整個服裝電商大盤的六倍，消費者正在為嚮往感而非性價比買單。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">時尚品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">電商經營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"512 – Oops, All Henrys exchequer investiture controversy homage mark\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-britishhist-把6岁女儿嫁给未来皇帝-英格兰国库的第一笔开支是联姻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>把6歲女兒嫁給未來皇帝：英格蘭國庫的第一筆開支是聯姻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利把6歲的女兒許配給靠軟禁父親上位的德意志國王，為此開出的一萬馬克聘金，與魯弗斯當年賣掉整個諾曼底公國的價碼完全相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">王室聯姻</span><span class=\"tag\">封建效忠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen and His Spy Romeo Entity List\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-chinatalk-商务部明知英伟达合作方由中国间谍操控-仍放行48亿美元芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19b361072bd3e2fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>商務部明知英偉達合作方由中國間諜操控，仍放行48億美元芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商務部早已掌握Megaspeed由中國間諜運營的情報，仍選擇不執行本可阻斷其芯片供應的既有規定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Frontier Labs Buy: A Data Deep Dive with Handshake AI — Garrett Lord &amp; Team RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) reward hacking redlining Care Bench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-latentspace-银行家宁可从零重做-也不愿修改ai给出的95-正确答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1b6b68e7fa0afc2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>銀行家寧可從零重做，也不願修改AI給出的95%正確答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修復一個95%正確的AI輸出，花的時間和從零開始一樣多，因為錯誤藏在公式與判斷的細節裡，而非表層格式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據標註</span><span class=\"tag\">金融建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anne of Brittany proxy marriage book of hours Estates of Brittany\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-stuffmissed-安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国-死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>安妮公爵夫人三次聯姻周旋法國，死後十八年布列塔尼還是被吞併</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安妮一生三次嫁人、兩次加冕法國王后，用婚姻條款逼法國承認布列塔尼的獨立地位，但她死後國王還是違揹她的遺願，把布列塔尼併入了法國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治聯姻</span><span class=\"tag\">布列塔尼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Kupor on Building a16z and Rebuilding the Federal Workforce OPM GS-14 permissioned risk time-in-grade phalanx\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-a16z-美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>美國政府退休審批最後一步是郵寄進賓州一座地下礦洞人工翻檔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">退休申請走完所有流程後，紙質件要被送進賓夕法尼亞一座廢棄石灰岩礦洞人工歸檔——卡住它的不是技術，是沒人願意為改善系統去承擔被國會問責的風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Retelling history in art and drama Joint Stock corpsing Boko Haram\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-startweek-今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守-不是更开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>今天的英國劇場比1970年代更保守，不是更開放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《雲的九種形態》導演坦言：如今英國新劇遠比1970年代更拘謹，復排時特意將後半段處理成一齣年代戲，因為那種坦率尺度已經回不去了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殖民歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">戲劇改編</span>\n</div></div></a>"]